  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Search and Rescue and Protection of Human Rights of Migrants at Sea: A Training Curriculum for the MENA Region</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">In order to strengthen its Member States&#x2019; capacities to address maritime security challenges and maritime SAR operations and in response to the continuous and growing needs, IOM will add on the best practices, lessons learnt and outcomes from previous capacity building initiatives&#x2014;the project will allow IOM to increase both advocacy and capacity of actors to protect and uphold the rights pf migrants in the Mediterranean in a in a manner that is consistent with international law and standards of best practice.</narrative>
  </description>
